# INDEX: REFACTORING

## Required

1. `project-rules/rules/architecture_rules.md`
2. `project-rules/rules/operational_rules.md`

## On trigger

- `ui_rules.md`: the reorganization touches presentation.
- `domain_rules.md`: the reorganization touches contract/mapping.
- `error_handling_rules.md`: the reorganization touches error flow.
- `auth_rules.md`: the reorganization touches access/permission.
- `security_rules.md`: the reorganization touches sensitive data.

Load every triggered rule before the first edit, in batches of up to two.

## References

- `domain_examples.md`: mapping/copyWith pattern when reorganizing a contract or shared model.
